<title>USA: Gateway to unveil new PC/TV technology.</title>
<headline>Gateway to unveil new PC/TV technology.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gateway 2000 Inc said Monday it will unveil on Thursday new technology available for the Big Screen PC/TV.</p>
<p>The announcement will be made together with Toshiba Corp, Time Warner Inc and Chromatic Research, Gateway said.</p>
<p>Gateway said it will hold a presentation on Thursday in Atlanta, followed by a question and answer session and demonstrations of the new technology.</p>
<p>Gateway 2000 is a direct marketer of computers and related equipment.</p>
<p>	  ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
